  "description": "The Nucleus 24 is based on our award winning Nucleus adult's range, featuring progressive geometry and simple confidence inspiring components. Ideal for a first experience of trail riding.\n\nBuilt around a lightweight Aluminium frame and an age appropriate wheel size, but featuring many of the performance focused components found on the adults bikes.\n\nUpgraded for 2021 with the excellent BOX Four 8 groupset, featuring a clutch activated rear mech, and a 1X chainring. This 1 x 8 speed system paired with the 30T ring and 11-34 cassette is the perfect setup to start ripping the trails. Up front the suspension is taken care of by Suntour XCR-DS-LO 65mm travel air suspension fork with lock out - adjustable for rider weight.\n\nTektro hydraulic disc brakes with a 160mm rotor's offer great stopping power and adjustable reach levers.Vitus wheels featuring Schwalbe Rocket Ron 2.1\" tyres, and an all Alumninium finishng kit give the bike a look even parents are envious of.\n\nBox 1x8 speed drivetrain\n\nSamox chainset with double chainguard\n\nCluch rear derailleur\n\nSuntour XCR-DS-LO Air forks - 65mm travel\n\nTektro M276 hydraulic disc brakes\n\nSchwalbe Rocket Ron 2.1\" tyres",
